<title>USA: Comdisco unit teams up on business center.</title>
<headline>Comdisco unit teams up on business center.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comdisco Inc said Wednesday its Comdisco Disaster Recovery Services unit teamed up with MicroAge Inc to open a business recovery center in Arizona.</p>
<p>The new facility, on MicroAge's technology campus, offers 200 fully configured Workarea Recovery stations, with capabilities for local and wide area network recovery and distributed and large systems recovery. Comdisco said MicroAge may be called upon to deliver computer equipment to remote recovery sites as parrt of the agrement.</p>
<p>Comdisco provides information technology services.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
